{"hymn":"S97","parent":"E1094","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":1},"title":"Las naciones se reúnen","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su victoria y exaltación","syl":{"n1":"Las","n2":["na","i"],"n3":["cio","m"],"n5":["nes","t"],"n6":"se","n7":["re","i"],"n8":["ú","m"],"n10":["nen","t"],"n11":["E‿i","i"],"n12":["ma","m"],"n13":["gi","m"],"n14":["nan","t"],"n15":["va","i"],"n17":["ni","m"],"n18":["dad.","t"],"n19":["To","i"],"n20":["do","t"],"n21":["rei","i"],"n23":["no‿y","t"],"n24":["prin","i"],"n25":["ci","m"],"n26":["pa","m"],"n28":["do","t"],"n29":["Con","i"],"n30":["tra","t"],"n31":"Dios","n33":["o","i"],"n34":["pues","m"],"n35":["to‿es","m"],"n36":["tá.","t"],"n37":"\"Sus","n38":["ca","i"],"n39":["de","m"],"n40":["nas","t"],"n41":"hoy","n42":["rom","i"],"n43":["pa","m"],"n45":["mos,","t"],"n46":["To","i"],"n47":["da","t"],"n49":["cuer","i"],"n50":["da‿hay","t"],"n51":"que","n53":["cor","i"],"n54":["tar\".","t"],"n55":["Es","i"],"n56":["to","t"],"n57":["tra","i"],"n59":["man","t"],"n60":["con","i"],"n61":["tra","t"],"n62":["Cris","i"],"n64":["to,","t"],"n65":"El","n66":["Un","i"],"n67":["gi","m"],"n69":["do‿de","t"],"n70":["Je","i"],"n71":["ho","m"],"n72":["vá.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Quien se sienta en los cielos","De‿ellos pronto se reirá;","En Su‿enojo‿e ira‿ardiente,","Él los ha de aterrar.","Tiene Dios al Rey ungido","Sobre‿el monte santo, Sión.","A los reyes les advierte","La declaración de Dios."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Les declara‿el cristo‿ungido","Lo que Dios ya decretó:","\"Este dia te‿he‿engendrado,","Primogénito de Dios.","Como Tu herencia propia,","Las naciones te daré.","Las quebrantará Tu vara,","Excelente‿ungido Rey\"."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Gobernantes de la tierra,","Oigan la‿amonestación:","Tomen al Señor y tiemblen,","Sírvanle con gozo hoy.","Tienen que besar al Hijo,","Y no enojar a Dios.","Todos los que‿en Él confían,","Gozarán de bendición."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Hemos visto al Ungido.","Te‿alabamos, Dios de‿amor,","Y, besando a tu Hijo,","Nuestra vanidad cesó.","No \"los que la ley hoy guardan\"","Mas \"los que confían en Él\",","Son benditos para siempre","Por haber creído‿en Él."]}]}